│   //! Unit tests for Pricing Engine VN — Dynamic Price Cases                 │
│   //!                                                                        │
│   //! C1: Weekend uplift (day-of-week-based dynamic pricing)                 │
│   //! C2: Holiday/special-date uplift (calendar-event-based dynamic          │
│   pricing)                                                                   │
│   //!                                                                        │
│   //! These test cases verify that prices are dynamically adjusted           │
│   //! based on temporal context (weekends and holidays/special dates),       │
│   //! following the SkyHotel pricing logic ported to Rust.                   │
